 "raw_output": "Coca-Cola's gross profit fell about 6.7% from fiscal Q1 2023 to fiscal Q4 2023.\n\n- **Q1 2023 gross profit:** $6,663 million, from the Q1 2024 10-Q comparative column.\n- **Q4 2023 gross profit:** the Q4 figure is not reported directly, so I derived it. Full-year 2023 gross profit was $27,234 million and the nine months ended September 29, 2023 were $21,019 million. The difference is $6,215 million.\n- **Change:** (6,215 \u2212 6,663) / 6,663 = \u2212448 / 6,663 \u2248 \u22126.72%.\n\n{\"value\": -6.72, \"unit\": \"percent\", \"choice\": null, \"status\": \"answered\"}",
